nged wherever necessary to make them comparable.      5. The Group is in the business of manufacturing chemicals and accordingly has one reportable   business segment.       6. For more details on results, visit investor relations section of the Company's website at https://neogenchem.com/financial-performance/ and financial result under corporates section of Stock Exchange's website at www.nseindia.com and www.bseindia.com.       5. The company is in the business of manufacturing specialty chemicals and accordingly has one reportable business segment.      6. For more details on results, visit investor relations section of the Company's website at https://neogenchem.com/financial-performance/ and financial result under corporates section of Stock Exchange's website at www.nseindia.com and www.bseindia.com.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
